(OneLogica Corporate Overview and Executive Governance) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (OneLogica Technologies Inc. was founded in 2021 by CEO Elena Vance and CTO Marcus Zhao.) Tj
T* (The global headquarters is located in San Francisco, California.) Tj
T* (The core mission is providing local-first, privacy-preserving AI platforms for enterprise analytics.) Tj
T* (The fiscal year commences on February 1 and concludes annually on January 31.) Tj
T* (Governance is overseen by a five-member Board of Directors with quarterly meetings.) Tj
T* (Corporate policies apply to all full-time, part-time, and contract personnel globally.) Tj
ET
