(Business Travel and Expense Reimbursement Policy) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Employees traveling on official company business are entitled to travel reimbursement.) Tj
T* (The standard domestic meal per diem allowance is 75 dollars per day.) Tj
T* (For commercial flights, any flight duration exceeding 4 hours qualifies for premium economy.) Tj
T* (Hotel lodging is capped at a maximum of 250 dollars per night in tier-one metropolitan cities.) Tj
T* (Ground transportation via rideshare or public transit is fully reimbursable.) Tj
T* (All travel expense reimbursement reports must be submitted within 30 days of trip completion.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
