(Paid Time Off Holidays and Parental Leave Policy) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Regular full-time salaried employees accrue 20 days of paid vacation annually.) Tj
T* (In addition to annual vacation, the company formally observes 11 official federal holidays.) Tj
T* (Employees may roll over up to 5 unused PTO days into the following calendar year.) Tj
T* (Primary caregiver parental leave provides 16 consecutive weeks of fully paid leave.) Tj
T* (Secondary caregivers receive 6 weeks of fully paid parental leave upon birth or adoption.) Tj
T* (Bereavement leave provides up to 5 consecutive paid days for immediate family members.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
