(Health Coverage Wellness Stipend and 401k Retirement Plan) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (OneLogica provides comprehensive health insurance covering medical, dental, and vision.) Tj
T* (The employer covers 90 percent of monthly health insurance premiums for employees.) Tj
T* (Full-time team members receive an annual wellness stipend of 600 dollars for fitness and gym.) Tj
T* (Through the corporate 401k plan, the company matches contributions dollar-for-dollar up to 5 percent.) Tj
T* (Employer 401k matching contributions vest 100 percent immediately on day one of employment.) Tj
T* (Health savings accounts HSA feature an employer seed contribution of 500 dollars annually.) Tj
ET
endstream
