(Remote Work Hardware Lifecycle and Security Standards) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Remote employees receive a one-time home office equipment stipend of 1000 dollars for furniture.) Tj
T* (Company-issued work laptops follow a scheduled hardware refresh cycle every 3 years.) Tj
T* (Information security policy mandates multi-factor authentication with FIDO2 hardware keys.) Tj
T* (All corporate account passwords must be at least 16 characters in length.) Tj
T* (Unattended workstations must automatically lock after 5 minutes of inactivity.) Tj
T* (Confidential customer data must never be exported to unencrypted personal storage devices.) Tj
ET
